   <title>Human trafficking victims stranded in Guinea-Bissau</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/human-trafficking-victims-stranded-in-guinea-bissau/a-79785558?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss</link>
   <description>Dozens of West Africans lured to Guinea-Bissau with promises of jobs and migration to Europe say they were exploited by a suspected trafficking network. Now many cannot afford to return home.</description>
