   <title>One year on, families seek justice after election violence</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/one-year-on-families-seek-justice-after-election-violence/a-79779105?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss</link>
   <description>One year after Tanzania&#039;s deadly post-election violence, families are still seeking answers. A government inquiry recorded 518 deaths. DW research has documented apparent use of excessive force by security forces.</description>
